cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you refer to this software, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "Inventario: physical inventory reconciliation between barcode terminals and ERP count tags (2002)"
version: "1.2.4"
abstract: "Inventario supports the yearly physical stock count. Lots counted in the warehouse with handheld barcode terminals are imported from fixed-width text files and matched with the count tags generated by the MFG/PRO ERP, so that missing, duplicated or misplaced lots can be found before the inventory is closed."
authors:
  - family-names: Sbarbaro
    given-names: Massimo
